@SSA.SDS.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5007
@Authorization = Bearer TOKEN

### Login
POST {{SSA.SDS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

###
# Sostituire TOKEN con l'accessToken restituito dal login

### Dashboard stats
GET {{SSA.SDS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/stats
Authorization: {{Authorization}}

###
### Lista clienti
GET {{SSA.SDS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/clients
Authorization: {{Authorization}}

###
### Lista schede
GET {{SSA.SDS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/safety-cards
Authorization: {{Authorization}}

###
### Schede in scadenza (90 giorni)
GET {{SSA.SDS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/scenarios/expiring?days=90
Authorization: {{Authorization}}

###
### Notifiche
GET {{SSA.SDS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/notifications
Authorization: {{Authorization}}

###
### Storico import
GET {{SSA.SDS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/import/history
Authorization: {{Authorization}}

###
### Prodotti chimici
GET {{SSA.SDS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/chemical-products
Authorization: {{Authorization}}

###
### Refresh token
POST {{SSA.SDS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "REFRESH_TOKEN"
}
